    "summary": "\\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n KENT Gold UF Water Purifier is a non-electric, gravity-based water purifier featuring a 0.1-micron Ultra Filtration membrane that removes bacteria and cysts without chemicals while retaining essential minerals. With a 20-litre storage capacity and 20 LPH purification rate , it is an ideal soluti",
    "description": "The <strong data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"103\">KENT Gold UF Water Purifier</strong> is an advanced <strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"165\">non-electric, gravity-based water purifier</strong> designed specifically for homes receiving <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"267\">low TDS tap water or municipal corporation water supply</strong>. It utilizes <strong data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"317\">Ultra Filtration (UF) technology</strong> with a <strong data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"373\">0.1-micron hollow fibre hydrophilic membrane</strong> that effectively removes bacteria, cysts, and other disease-causing microorganisms without the use of electricity or chemicals.\r\\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"pm8yra\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1417\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1417\">Key Features</strong></span></h3>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"ydqtlu\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1498\"><strong data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1460\">Advanced UF Purification Technology</strong> with 0.1-micron hollow fibre membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"dfnui1\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1554\">Removes <strong data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1554\">bacteria, cysts, and suspended impurities</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"11ejb0i\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1616\"><strong data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1588\">100% Non-Electric Operation</strong> – Works without electricity</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1i09wka\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1688\"><strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1649\">Chemical-Free Purification</strong> – No chlorine, bromine, or iodine used</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1f3dhh1\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1740\"><strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1731\">Preserves Essential Natural Minerals</strong> in water</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"80xpfn\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1787\"><strong data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1765\">20 Litres Per Hour</strong> purification capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"14sjloa\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1849\"><strong data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1815\">20-Litre Storage Tank</strong> for continuous water availability</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"m5u6h8\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1902\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1902\">Low TDS Tap &amp; Municipal Water Supply</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1psr5p8\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1945\">Hygienic <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1945\">Food-Grade ABS Plastic Body</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"bpx4x1\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1976\">Compact <strong data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1976\">Table-Top Design</strong></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2016\" />\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gqkziz\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2050\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2050\">Technical Specifications</strong></span></h3>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2068\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specification</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2079\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2137\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2136\">Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2162\">Ultra Filtration (UF)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2191\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2190\">UF Membrane Pore Size</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2205\">0.1 Micron</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2224\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2223\">Application</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2257\">Tap &amp; Municipal Low TDS Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2302\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2286\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2285\">Purification Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2302\">Up to 20 LPH</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2326\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2325\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2339\">20 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2356\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2355\">Operation</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2387\">Non-Electric, Gravity-Based</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2421\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2408\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2407\">Mounting Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2421\">Table-Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2442\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2441\">Body Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2468\">Food-Grade ABS Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2488\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2487\">Product Code</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2498\">111014</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2527\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2516\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2515\">Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2527\">2.60 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2579\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2557\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2556\">Dimensions (L × W × H)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2579\">325 × 355 × 520 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
