    "summary": "The Enviro 2” Water Structuring Device is a maintenance-free, chemical-free solution designed for high-flow residential, commercial, and industrial water systems. It helps reduce hard water scaling, protects equipment and plumbing, and operates without electricity, salt, filters, or replacement parts.",
    "description": "<section class=\"product-features\">\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Fully Automatic Operation</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Moving Parts</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Electricity Required</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Chemicals or Salt Usage</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Filters or Consumables</li>\r\\n \t<li>Minimal Maintenance</li>\r\\n \t<li>Durable and Long-Lasting Design</li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for High-Flow Water Systems</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</section><section class=\"product-description\">\r\\n<h2>About Product</h2>\r\\nThe Enviro 2” Water Structuring Device is a fully automatic water conditioning solution designed for larger residential, commercial, and industrial applications. It helps reduce the scale-forming properties of hard water without using chemicals, salt, or electricity.\r\\n\r\\nThe system protects pipelines, plumbing fixtures, water heaters, boilers, cooling systems, and other equipment from mineral buildup, helping to extend their service life and improve operational efficiency.\r\\n\r\\nIt minimizes mineral deposits on fixtures and surfaces, reducing maintenance and cleaning requirements while keeping water systems running smoothly.\r\\n\r\\nWith no moving parts, filters, or consumables, the device offers hassle-free operation, minimal maintenance, and no recurring replacement costs.\r\\n\r\\nIdeal for apartment complexes, residential communities, hotels, hospitals, educational institutions, commercial buildings, and industrial process water systems, it provides a reliable and eco-friendly solution for hard water management.\r\\n\r\\nBy naturally conditioning water and reducing scale formation, the Enviro 2” Water Structuring Device helps maintain cleaner plumbing systems, improves equipment longevity, and supports efficient water usage for high-flow applications.\r\\n\r\\n</section>",
    "shortDescription": "The Enviro 2” Water Structuring Device is a maintenance-free, chemical-free solution designed for high-flow residential, commercial, and industrial water systems. It helps reduce hard water scaling, protects equipment and plumbing, and operates without electricity, salt, filters, or replacement parts.",
