    "description": "<h3>About Purella SILK – SS Tank</h3>\\n<p>A masterpiece in water purification, designed for those who seek elegance, durability, and advanced technology in one seamless experience.</p>\\n<p>Crafted with SS Grade 304 Stainless Steel, Silk stands strong with an anti-corrosive, tough, and durable build—ensuring longevity like never before.</p>\\n<p>Stay informed with an interactive LED display that offers real-time purification insights at a glance with 8 stages of advanced purification, Silk effortlessly removes impurities, purifies up to 3000 TDS, and ensures every drop is rich in minerals.</p>\\n<p>Certified for excellence—Silk features NSF, WPS, and RoHS-certified filtration, ensuring international standards of purity and safety.</p>\\n<p>With duo-sealing protection, your water remains untouched, untainted, and unbelievably fresh.</p>\\n<p>Designed for your convenience, Silk boasts a long filter life—purifying up to 7200 liters without compromise.</p>\\n<p>Experience the future of water purification. Silk – Timeless Purity. Enduring Strength.</p>\\n<h4>Features</h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Minimum 40% water recovery rate</li>\\n<li>Filter life of up to 7200 Liters</li>\\n<li>Smart LED Screen</li>\\n<li>ISI certified Purifier</li>\\n<li>NSF, WPS, and ROHS certified Filters</li>\\n<li>Antimicrobial Storage Tank – 8.5 Liters</li>\\n</ol>\\n<h4>Design</h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Smart Screen with 3 LED display – Power ON, Tank Full, Purifying, UV/LPS fail, Filter Life 1, Filter Life 2</li>\\n<li>Drip Tray</li>\\n<li>Wall Mount / Table Top</li>\\n<li>Net Dimension – L 36.5 x W 32.5 x H 52.6 wxdxh (cm)</li>\\n<li>Net Weight – 10.50 Kgs</li>\\n</ol>",
