    "summary": "Water Conditioner \\nPurella SoftWa brings a happy and healthy lifestyle to you. It helps in protecting your appliances like Washing Machine, Dishwasher and Geyser from lime scale with its dual filtration process.",
    "description": "<h3>About Purella SoftWa – Water Conditioner</h3>\\n<p>Purella SoftWa brings happy and healthy lifestyle to you. It helps in protecting your appliances like Washing machine, Dishwasher and Geyser.</p>\\n<p>Purella SoftWa has dual filtration process. Mesh-Filter helps in removing visible impurities and Heavy dust Particles and Polyphosphate Silicate Sphere Remove Lime-scale and Conditions Water.</p>\\n<p>A blend of conscious design, proven technology and versatility was envisioned while creation of Purella SoftWa. Made in India, Purella SoftWa is developed in such a way that it fits directly on tap and on the appliances too, this feature helps to avoid dead space created by such filters if fitted behind appliance.</p>\\n<h4>Benefits</h4>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Washing Machine:</strong> Protects from lime scales and extends its life. Improves washing by reducing lime scale on clothes. Preserves clothes colour and natural softness.</li>\\n<li><strong>Geyser:</strong> Protects from Lime Scale and extends its life. Gives Conditioned/Polished water (Lime-scale Free).</li>\\n<li><strong>Dishwasher:</strong> Protects from lime scales and extends its life. Does not leave stains of lime scale on utensils. Maintains shine of stainless-steel utensils.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h4>How the Filters Work</h4>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Mesh Filter:</strong> Removes visible impurities and Heavy Dust Particles.</li>\\n<li><strong>Polyphosphate Silicate Spheres:</strong> Remove Lime-scale and Condition Water.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h4>Product Technical Specifications</h4>\\n<table>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr><th>Brand Name</th><td>Purella</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Installation Type</th><td>Tap Mounted</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Maximum Flow Rate</th><td>6.00 liters per minute</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Maximum Operating Pressure</th><td>5–55 psi</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Temperature Range</th><td>5–60 °C</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Dimension</th><td>7.6 x 7.6 x 23 cm</td></tr>\\n<tr><th>Weight</th><td>396 gms</td></tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h4>Box Includes</h4>\\n<p>4 Tap connectors, 1 Water Conditioner Filter, 1 Spanner, 1 Versatile Tap attachment, 1 User Manual, 1 Teflon Tape, 1 Sant Paper, 1 Pipe Connector.</p>\\n<p><em>Please note: It does not remove or reduce TDS level.</em></p>",
    "shortDescription": "<p><strong>Water Conditioner</strong><br />\\nPurella SoftWa brings a happy and healthy lifestyle to you. It helps in protecting your appliances like Washing Machine, Dishwasher and Geyser from lime scale with its dual filtration process.</p>",
