    "summary": "KENT Crystal Alkaline B uses multiple purification process of RO+UV+UF+ Alkaline +TDS Control to remove all dissolved impurities, bacteria and viruses while retaining essential natural minerals in water with KENT’s mineral RO™ technology and enhances the pH level of the purified water up to 9.5. Its UV LED light keeps",
    "description": "<!-- ========================= BEST FEATURES ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%;\">\r\\n<h2>KENT Crystal Alkaline  – Product Description</h2>\r\\nThe <strong>KENT Crystal Alkaline </strong> is an advanced wall-mounted water purifier designed to provide <strong>100% pure, safe, and healthy drinking water</strong>. It features a powerful <strong>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + TDS Control</strong> purification process that effectively removes bacteria, viruses, dissolved impurities, heavy metals, chemicals, pesticides, arsenic, rust, and fluoride while retaining essential natural minerals.\r\\n\r\\nIts <strong>Alkaline Technology</strong> enriches the purified water with a <strong>pH level of up to 9.5</strong>, helping regulate the body's pH balance, reduce acidity, support immunity, and promote overall wellness. The inbuilt <strong>TDS Controller</strong> maintains the desired TDS level while preserving essential minerals for healthier and better-tasting water.\r\\n\r\\nWith a <strong>purification capacity of up to 20 litres per hour</strong> and a generous <strong>11-litre storage tank</strong>, the purifier ensures an uninterrupted supply of clean drinking water even during power outages. The integrated <strong>water level indicator</strong> allows users to easily monitor the available purified water. Additionally, the <strong>UV LED disinfection system inside the storage tank</strong> continuously keeps stored water free from bacterial growth.\r\\n\r\\nBacked by <strong>1-year warranty</strong> and <strong>3 years of extended free service</strong>, the KENT Crystal Alkaline B combines advanced purification technology with reliable performance for every household.\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Advanced RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + TDS Control</strong> purification</li>\r\\n \t<li>Removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, pesticides, arsenic, rust, fluoride, and dissolved impurities</li>\r\\n \t<li>Delivers <strong>alkaline drinking water with pH up to 9.5</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>TDS Controller</strong> retains essential natural minerals</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>20 L/hr</strong> high purification capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>11-litre</strong> storage tank for continuous water availability</li>\r\\n \t<li>UV purification inside the storage tank prevents bacterial growth</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water level indicator for easy monitoring</li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for <strong>Brackish, Tap, and Municipal Corporation water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Food-grade ABS plastic body</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall-mount design</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>1-Year Warranty + 3 Years Extended Free Service</strong></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<thead>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Specification</th>\r\\n<th>Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Model</td>\r\\n<td>KENT Crystal Alkaline</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Product Code</td>\r\\n<td>111189B</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purification Technology</td>\r\\n<td>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + TDS Control</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Suitable Water Source</td>\r\\n<td>Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Installation Type</td>\r\\n<td>Wall Mounted</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Body Material</td>\r\\n<td>Food Grade ABS Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purification Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>Up to 20 Litres/Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Storage Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>11 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Input Power Supply</td>\r\\n<td>Single Phase 100–250V AC, 50–60Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Power Consumption</td>\r\\n<td>60 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Net Weight</td>\r\\n<td>8.8 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Dimensions (L × W × H)</td>\r\\n<td>380 × 280 × 535 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Water Quality</td>\r\\n<td>Mineral-rich alkaline water (pH up to 9.5)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Warranty</td>\r\\n<td>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Extended Free Service</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;\"></div>",
