    "summary": "The Enviro 1” Water Structuring Device is a maintenance-free, eco-friendly solution that helps reduce hard water scaling without using electricity, chemicals, salt, or replacement parts. It protects plumbing systems and household appliances while improving efficiency and reducing maintenance costs.",
    "description": "<section class=\"product-features\">\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Fully Automatic Operation</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Moving Parts</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Electricity Required</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Chemicals or Salt Usage</li>\r\\n \t<li>No Filters or Replacement Parts</li>\r\\n \t<li>Minimal Maintenance</li>\r\\n \t<li>Long-Lasting Performance</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</section><section class=\"product-description\">\r\\n<h2>About Product</h2>\r\\nThe Enviro 1” Water Structuring Device is an advanced, maintenance-free water conditioning solution designed to reduce the scale-forming properties of hard water. It operates without electricity, chemicals, salt, or replacement parts, making it an eco-friendly and cost-effective choice for homes and commercial spaces.\r\\n\r\\nIt helps minimize scale buildup in pipelines, plumbing systems, water heaters, geysers, and household appliances, improving their efficiency and extending their lifespan.\r\\n\r\\nThe device reduces white spots and mineral deposits on fixtures and surfaces,lowering maintenance and cleaning efforts while promoting a cleaner water system.\r\\n\r\\nDesigned for individual homes, apartments, villas, residential complexes, and small commercial establishments, it offers a sustainable and hassle-free solution for hard water problems.\r\\n\r\\nBy naturally conditioning water without chemicals or ongoing maintenance, the Enviro 1” Water Structuring Device helps keep plumbing systems cleaner and appliances performing efficiently for years.\r\\n\r\\n</section>",
    "shortDescription": "The Enviro 1” Water Structuring Device is a maintenance-free, eco-friendly solution that helps reduce hard water scaling without using electricity, chemicals, salt, or replacement parts. It protects plumbing systems and household appliances while improving efficiency and reducing maintenance costs.",
