    "description": "<section class=\"product-features\">\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Reduces White Scaling and Mineral Deposits</li>\r\\n \t<li>Protects Geysers, Washing Machines, and Household Appliances</li>\r\\n \t<li>Extends the Life of Plumbing Pipelines</li>\r\\n \t<li>Improves Skin and Hair Protection from Hard Water Effects</li>\r\\n \t<li>Maintains Cleaner Bathrooms and Utility Areas</li>\r\\n \t<li>Low Maintenance with Long-Lasting Performance</li>\r\\n \t<li>Odourless and Tasteless Media</li>\r\\n \t<li>pH Neutral and Chemical-Free Operation</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</section><section class=\"product-description\">\r\\n<h2>About Product</h2>\r\\nEnviro Brine+ Hard Water Conditioner is designed to protect homes from the damaging effects of hard water caused by high levels of calcium and magnesium minerals commonly found in borewell water.\r\\n\r\\nIt helps reduce white scaling and mineral deposits on taps, showerheads, bathroom tiles, pipelines, geysers, and other household appliances, keeping your home cleaner and better protected.\r\\n\r\\nThe advanced conditioning technology utilizes a proprietary process that alters the behavior of calcium minerals, helping them remain in a non-adherent state and reducing their tendency to form hard scale deposits inside pipes and on surfaces.\r\\n\r\\nBy minimizing scaling and corrosion, the system helps extend the lifespan of plumbing networks, geyser heating elements, washing machines, and other utility equipment.\r\\n\r\\nIt also improves the bathing experience by reducing the harsh effects of hard water on skin and hair, contributing to a cleaner and healthier living environment.\r\\n\r\\nThe conditioner operates without chemicals and features odourless, tasteless, and pH-neutral media, making it suitable for residential borewell water applications.\r\\n\r\\nIdeal for independent houses, villas, apartments, farmhouses, residential complexes, and utility water lines, Enviro Brine+ delivers reliable performance with minimal maintenance requirements.\r\\n\r\\n</section>",
    "shortDescription": "Enviro Brine+ Hard Water Conditioner helps reduce scaling and mineral deposits caused by hard borewell water, protecting plumbing systems, household appliances, skin, and hair. Its chemical-free, low-maintenance design ensures long-lasting performance for residential water conditioning applications.",
