    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"491\">The <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"82\">A.O. Smith Intelli UV </strong>is a stylish wall-mounted UV water purifier designed for homes with municipal water supply (TDS below 200 ppm). Featuring a <strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"248\">5-stage UV + SAPC purification system</strong> and <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"289\">India's 1st Dual Pass UV Chamber</strong>, it delivers safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. Its elegant design, <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"392\">touch dispensing</strong>, <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"417\">digital LED display</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"444\">4.5L storage tank</strong> make it a perfect addition to modern kitchens.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pm8yra\" data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"513\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"513\">Key Features</strong></span></h3>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"1361\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"550\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"550\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"529\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"528\">Feature</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"550\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"548\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"1361\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"651\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"607\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"606\">Purifier Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"651\">UV + SAPC (Silver Activated Post Carbon)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"675\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"669\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"668\">Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"675\">UV</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"783\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"701\">Purification Stages</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"783\">5 Stage (SCB® Filter + UV Lamp + Silver Activated Post Carbon + Ultra Shield)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"864\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"812\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"811\">Suitable Water Source</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"864\">Municipal Corporation Supply (TDS below 200 ppm)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"908\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"888\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"887\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"908\" data-col-size=\"md\">Up to 4.5 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"947\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"933\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"932\">Installation Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"947\">Wall Mount</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"988\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"970\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"969\">Dispensing Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"988\">Touch Dispense</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1003\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1002\">Display</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1026\">LED Digital Display</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1050\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1049\">Special Features</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1121\">India's 1st Dual Pass UV Chamber, Touch Dispensing, Digital Display</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1144\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1143\">Pressure Rating</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1156\">5–30 psi</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1177\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1176\">Input Voltage</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1198\">150–300V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1223\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1222\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1237\">48 W (Max)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1257\">UV Lamp Power</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1266\">11 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1295\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1294\">Storage Tank Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1309\">Food Grade</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1361\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1339\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1338\">Dimensions (H × D × W)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1361\" data-is-last-node=\"\">445 × 191 × 300 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
