    "description": "<!-- ========================= BEST FEATURES ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">Best Features</h2>\r\\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;\">\r\\n \t<li>Most Advanced RO Water Purifier with RO + UF + UV + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control</li>\r\\n \t<li>IoT-Powered Smart Monitoring through Mobile App</li>\r\\n \t<li>Makes drinking water 100% pure</li>\r\\n \t<li>Retains essential natural minerals in purified water</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purified water enriched with the goodness of Active Copper</li>\r\\n \t<li>Provides alkaline water with pH 8.0–9.5</li>\r\\n \t<li>Digital display for real-time purity and performance monitoring</li>\r\\n \t<li>UV LED Light in the storage tank keeps purified water fresh and bacteria-free</li>\r\\n \t<li>High purification capacity of 20 L/hr</li>\r\\n \t<li>8L storage capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</li>\r\\n \t<li>Trusted by about 1 crore satisfied consumers across India</li>\r\\n \t<li>International Quality Certifications: NSF &amp; ISI</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<!-- ========================= ABOUT PRODUCT ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">About Product</h2>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\"><strong>KENT Sapphire IoT</strong> is one of the most advanced RO water purifiers, featuring an intelligent <strong>RO + UF + UV + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control</strong> purification system that delivers 100% pure, safe, and healthy drinking water. It effectively removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, heavy metals, and dissolved impurities such as arsenic, rust, pesticides, and fluorides while meeting IS:10500 drinking water standards.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">The purifier is equipped with <strong>IoT-powered smart monitoring</strong> that provides real-time information on water quality, filter life, and purifier performance through your mobile device. It also supports automatic service call registration, timely filter and membrane replacement notifications, and complete service and parts replacement history for maximum convenience.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">Its advanced <strong>TDS Control</strong> technology retains essential natural minerals, while <strong>Active Copper Technology</strong> enriches purified water with the goodness of copper. The integrated <strong>Alkaline Technology</strong> delivers mineral-rich water with a pH level between <strong>8.0 and 9.5</strong>, helping regulate the body's pH balance, reduce acidity, support immunity, and promote overall wellness.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">A smart <strong>Digital Display</strong> provides real-time information on water quality, filter life, and RO flow rate. The <strong>UV LED Light</strong> inside the storage tank continuously purifies the stored water to prevent bacterial growth and maintain long-lasting freshness. With a purification capacity of up to <strong>20 litres per hour</strong> and an <strong>8 litre storage tank</strong>, it ensures an uninterrupted supply of purified water even during power outages.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">Backed by a <strong>1 Year Warranty</strong> and <strong>3 Years Free Service</strong>, KENT Sapphire IoT is trusted by more than <strong>1 crore satisfied consumers</strong> across India. It has received numerous national and international awards and is certified by both <strong>BIS</strong> and <strong>NSF</strong>, ensuring world-class quality, safety, and long-lasting performance.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n<!-- ========================= TECHNICAL DETAILS ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">Technical Details</h2>\r\\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd; width: 35%;\">Application</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Suitable for purification of Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Product Code</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">111177B</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Mounting</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Wall Mounting / Table Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Body Material</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Purification Capacity</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">20 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">8L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Net Weight</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">8.30 Kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">360 (L) × 320 (W) × 500 (H) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Input Power Supply</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Single Phase 250V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">60W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>",
