    "summary": "KENT Grand IoT is the most advanced RO water purifier that uses a multiple purification process of RO+UV+UF+Alkaline+Copper+TDS Control + UV in Tank with advanced IoT intelligence that offers real-time display of water quality and filter life, along with timely notifications, automatic service call registration in case",
    "description": "<!-- ========================= BEST FEATURES ========================= -->\r\\n\r\\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;\">\r\\n\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\">Best Features</h2>\r\\n\r\\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:1.8;\">\r\\n    <li>Advanced RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control Purification</li>\r\\n    <li>IoT-Powered Smart Monitoring through Mobile App</li>\r\\n    <li>Makes drinking water 100% pure</li>\r\\n    <li>Retains essential natural minerals in purified water</li>\r\\n    <li>Purified water enriched with the goodness of Active Copper</li>\r\\n    <li>Provides alkaline water with pH 8.0–9.5</li>\r\\n    <li>Digital display for real-time purity and performance monitoring</li>\r\\n    <li>UV LED Light keeps purified water pure inside the storage tank</li>\r\\n    <li>High purification capacity of 20 L/hr</li>\r\\n    <li>9L storage capacity</li>\r\\n    <li>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</li>\r\\n    <li>Trusted by about 1 crore satisfied consumers across India</li>\r\\n    <li>International Quality Certifications: NSF &amp; ISI</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n\r\\n<!-- ========================= ABOUT PRODUCT ========================= -->\r\\n\r\\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;margin-top:30px;\">\r\\n\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\">About Product</h2>\r\\n\r\\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;\">\r\\n<strong>KENT Grand IoT</strong> is an advanced RO water purifier featuring a powerful <strong>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control + UV in Tank</strong> purification system that delivers 100% pure, safe, and healthy drinking water. It effectively removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, heavy metals, and dissolved impurities such as arsenic, rust, pesticides, and fluorides while meeting IS:10500 drinking water standards.\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;\">\r\\nEquipped with <strong>IoT-powered smart monitoring</strong>, the purifier provides real-time information on water quality, filter life, and purifier performance. It also supports automatic service call registration, timely filter and membrane replacement notifications, and maintains complete service and parts replacement history for added convenience.\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;\">\r\\nIts intelligent <strong>TDS Control</strong> technology retains essential natural minerals, while <strong>Active Copper Technology</strong> enriches purified water with the goodness of copper. The integrated <strong>Alkaline Technology</strong> provides mineral-rich water with a pH level between <strong>8.0 and 9.5</strong>, helping regulate the body's pH balance, reduce acidity, support immunity, and promote overall wellness.\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;\">\r\\nThe built-in <strong>Digital Display</strong> shows real-time water quality, filter life, and RO flow rate, while the <strong>UV LED Light</strong> continuously purifies the stored water inside the tank to prevent bacterial growth. With a purification capacity of up to <strong>20 litres per hour</strong> and a <strong>9 litre storage tank</strong>, it ensures a continuous supply of purified water even during power outages.\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n<p style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;\">\r\\nBacked by a <strong>1 Year Warranty</strong> and <strong>3 Years Free Service</strong>, KENT Grand IoT is trusted by more than <strong>1 crore satisfied consumers</strong> across India. It has received numerous national and international awards and is certified by both <strong>BIS</strong> and <strong>NSF</strong>, ensuring world-class quality, safety, and performance.\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n\r\\n<!-- ========================= TECHNICAL DETAILS ========================= -->\r\\n\r\\n<div style=\"width:100%;max-width:100%;margin-top:30px;\">\r\\n\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom:15px;\">Technical Details</h2>\r\\n\r\\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ddd;\">\r\\n    <tbody>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;width:35%;\">Application</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Suitable for purification of Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Product Code</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">111184B</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Mounting</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Wall Mounting</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Body Material</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Purification Capacity</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">20 L/hr</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">9L</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Net Weight</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">8.60 Kg</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">400 (L) × 230 (W) × 540 (H) mm</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Input Power Supply</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Single Phase 250V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n        <tr>\r\\n            <th style=\"padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n            <td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">60W</td>\r\\n        </tr>\r\\n    </tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
