    "summary": "About Purella SUPRA+ – 3 LED \\n RO + UV + ALKALINE \\n Technology that you can trust and taste. \\n The Epitome of trust and technology in water purification right in the comfort of your home. \\n Convenience like never before with its smart digital screen and sophisticated design. Certified by ISI, with NSF, WPS, and ROH",
