    "shortDescription": "This advanced <strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"67\">6-stage RO Water Purifier</strong> features <strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"117\">Silver Nano Self-Flushing Technology</strong>, <strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"170\">RO + UV + Alkaline + Copper + Zinc purification</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"203\">Manual TDS Controller</strong> to deliver safe, mineral-rich drinking water. Designed to purify water with <strong data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"302\">TDS up to 3000 PPM</strong>, it offers <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"350\">18–20 L/hr purification capacity</strong>, <strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"367\">11L storage</strong>, and a durable <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"406\">food-grade ABS body</strong>, making it ideal for homes using borewell, tanker, or municipal water.",
