    "description": "<div class=\"brand-product-content\">\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A high-performance domestic RO water purifier designed for brackish water conditions. Equipped with advanced Reverse Osmosis technology, a Thin Film Composite membrane, multi-stage filtration, and energy-efficient operation, it delivers safe and purified drinking water with reliable performance.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n \t<li>Advanced Reverse Osmosis (RO) purification technology</li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for brackish water applications</li>\r\\n \t<li>80 GPD Thin Film Composite (TFC) membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Multi-stage filtration with Micron, GAC, and Post Carbon filters</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification capacity of 12 litres per hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>Supports input TDS up to &lt;3000 PPM</li>\r\\n \t<li>Energy-efficient 50 W power consumption</li>\r\\n \t<li>Compact wall mount design with under-sink installation option</li>\r\\n \t<li>Automatic pressure pump system with 24V DC operation</li>\r\\n \t<li>Includes faucet, pressure tank, and 5-meter tube</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Specification</th>\r\\n<th>Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Technology</td>\r\\n<td>Reverse Osmosis (RO) System</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Application</td>\r\\n<td>Suitable for Brackish Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Membrane Type</td>\r\\n<td>Thin Film Composite (TFC)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Membrane Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>MEMBRELLA Alpha - 80 GPD</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Pump</td>\r\\n<td>TEKLEEN - 75 GPD</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purification Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>12 Litres/Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Maximum Operating TDS</td>\r\\n<td>&lt;3000 PPM</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Recovery Rate</td>\r\\n<td>&gt;40% at 27°C ± 2°C</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Filter Life</td>\r\\n<td>Approx. 3000 Litres / 6 Months</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Filters</td>\r\\n<td>10\" Micron Filter, 10\" GAC, 10\" Micron Filter, Post Carbon</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Input Voltage</td>\r\\n<td>100–300V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Operating Voltage</td>\r\\n<td>24V DC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Power Consumption</td>\r\\n<td>50W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Installation</td>\r\\n<td>Wall Mount with Under Sink</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Product Dimensions</td>\r\\n<td>450(H) × 190(W) × 355(L) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>System Weight</td>\r\\n<td>Approx. 6.610 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Country of Origin</td>\r\\n<td>India</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>",
