    "shortDescription": "The Ultima Plus RO + UV Water Purifier is designed to deliver pure, safe, and mineral-rich drinking water for homes using brackish water. Featuring advanced RO + UV purification with Alkaline and Copper filtration, it effectively removes dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, and excess TDS while enriching water with essential minerals. Powered by a 75 GPD low-pressure pump and equipped with a 10-litre storage tank, it offers reliable performance and healthy drinking water every day.",
