    "summary": "\\nThe MERLIN UNDERSINK is meticulously engineered to provide clean, premium water for your everyday household needs. Sourced to seamlessly process water from challenging lines like municipal supplies, tankers, or deep borewells, this system removes heavy dissolved salts, suspended debris, and harmful pathogens without",
    "description": "<div class=\"brand-product-content\">\r\\n\r\\n&nbsp;\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <strong>Merlin Under Sink UTC Water Purifier</strong> is a premium under-sink RO water purification system designed for brackish water with TDS levels up to <strong>2000 ppm</strong>. Equipped with a <strong>7-stage purification process</strong> including Sediment, Pre-Carbon, RO Membrane, Copper + Zinc Mineral Cartridge, UV, UF, and TDS Adjuster, it delivers safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. With a <strong>15-litre storage tank</strong>, <strong>12 LPH purification capacity</strong>, and <strong>free standard installation</strong>, it is an ideal solution for modern homes.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Specification</th>\r\\n<th>Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Model</td>\r\\n<td>Merlin Under Sink UTC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Technology</td>\r\\n<td>RO + UV + UF + TDS Adjuster</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Application</td>\r\\n<td>Suitable for Brackish Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purification Stages</td>\r\\n<td>Sediment, Pre-Carbon, RO, Copper + Zinc, UV, UF, Post Carbon</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Membrane</td>\r\\n<td>FILMTEC BW 60–75 GPD</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Membrane Type</td>\r\\n<td>Thin Film Composite (TFC)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Pump</td>\r\\n<td>MEMBRELLA – 75 GPD</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purification Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>12 Litres/Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Storage Capacity</td>\r\\n<td>15 Litres (4 Gallons)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Maximum Operating TDS</td>\r\\n<td>Up to 2000 ppm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Recovery Rate</td>\r\\n<td>More than 30%</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Filter Life</td>\r\\n<td>Approx. 6,000 Litres / 1 Year*</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Input Voltage</td>\r\\n<td>100–300V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Operating Voltage</td>\r\\n<td>24V DC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Power Consumption</td>\r\\n<td>48W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Minimum Inlet Pressure</td>\r\\n<td>0.3 kg/cm²</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Minimum Water Temperature</td>\r\\n<td>10°C</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Installation</td>\r\\n<td>Under Sink</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Warranty</td>\r\\n<td>1 Year</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Country of Origin</td>\r\\n<td>India</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n*Filter life may vary depending on the quality of the input water and usage conditions.\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "<h3></h3>\r\\nThe MERLIN UNDERSINK is meticulously engineered to provide clean, premium water for your everyday household needs. Sourced to seamlessly process water from challenging lines like municipal supplies, tankers, or deep borewells, this system removes heavy dissolved salts, suspended debris, and harmful pathogens without compromising on aesthetic styling or modern structural efficiency.",
