    "description": "<p data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"366\"><strong data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"59\">Mr Pure RO Water Purifier</strong> is an advanced <strong data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"108\">RO + UV + UF + TDS Controller</strong> water purification system designed for Indian households. It provides multi-stage purification to reduce dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, and other contaminants while helping retain essential minerals for better-tasting drinking water.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uvdx3z\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"390\">Key Specifications</h3>\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"808\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"413\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"413\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"402\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Feature</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"413\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"808\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"488\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"452\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"451\">Filtration Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"488\" data-col-size=\"sm\">RO + UV + UF + Mineral Retention</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"525\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"512\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"511\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"525\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10 Liters</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"568\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"550\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"549\">Purification Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"568\" data-col-size=\"sm\">15 Liters/Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"606\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"584\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"583\">Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"606\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Food-Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"638\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"631\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"630\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"638\" data-col-size=\"sm\">36W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"702\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"660\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"659\">Smart Features</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"702\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Filter Change Indicator, Auto Shut-Off</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"749\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"722\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"721\">Installation</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wall-Mount / Countertop</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"808\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"770\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"769\">Water Sources</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"808\">Borewell, Tanker &amp; Municipal Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fhyg08\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"839\">Key Features &amp; Advantages</h3>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"19audni\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"988\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"881\">Advanced RO + UV + UF Purification</strong> – Multi-stage purification helps reduce dissolved solids, bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, and impurities.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1gvozib\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1090\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1009\">TDS Controller</strong> – Helps adjust the taste of purified water according to the input water quality.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"11tmowk\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1206\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1118\">10-Litre Storage Tank</strong> – Provides a convenient supply of purified water, including during power interruptions.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"17rk8ob\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1303\"><strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1241\">15 LPH Purification Capacity</strong> – Suitable for regular household drinking-water requirements.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"16c0259\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1402\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1327\">Mineral Retention</strong> – Helps retain essential minerals while providing purified drinking water.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1n7nee9\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1491\"><strong data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1438\">Smart Filter Change Indicator</strong> – Provides a timely reminder for filter replacement.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1d7pbug\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1588\"><strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1511\">Auto Shut-Off</strong> – Enhances safety and helps prevent unnecessary water and power consumption.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1vzatiy\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1666\"><strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1611\">Energy Efficient</strong> – Operates at just <strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1638\">36W</strong> for efficient everyday use.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1u7hkwz\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1767\"><strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1696\">Food-Grade Construction</strong> – Durable, hygienic material suitable for drinking-water applications.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"12qkjhs\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1855\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1795\">Modern Compact Design</strong> – Suitable for contemporary kitchens and easy installation.</li>\r\\n</ul>",
    "shortDescription": "<strong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2024\">Mr Pure RO Water Purifier</strong> combines <strong data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2076\">RO, UV, UF, and TDS control technology</strong> to deliver clean, safe, and great-tasting drinking water. With a <strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2255\">10L storage tank, 15 LPH purification capacity, mineral retention, filter-change indicator, and auto shut-off</strong>, it is a practical and efficient choice for Indian households dealing with varying water quality and high TDS.",
