    "summary": "The all-new ZeroB Softener automatically converts hard water into soft, safe water, enhancing bathing, washing, and laundry while preventing scale and scum. Designed for easy installation, it features a robust automatic valve and proprietary purple food-grade resin, ensuring reliable performance and protection against",
    "description": "<div class=\"aakash-product-content\">\r\\n<h3>ZeroB Auto Softener 2.1</h3>\r\\nThe ZeroB Auto Softener 2.1 automatically converts hard water into soft, safe water for bathing, washing and laundry while preventing scale and scum. It features a robust 6-stage fully automatic valve, a Built-In No Hard Water Bypass Valve (NHBV) during regeneration, and proprietary food-grade, tamper-proof purple resin for reliable, long-lasting performance.\r\\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Fully automatic programmable process valve with zero manual intervention</li>\r\\n \t<li>Softens water and prevents scale, scum and corrosion damage to bathroom fittings and appliances</li>\r\\n \t<li>Reduces detergent and soap consumption while protecting fabric colour and texture</li>\r\\n \t<li>Increases the lifespan of washing machines, water heaters and other appliances</li>\r\\n \t<li>Uses ZeroB's proprietary Purple Resin Media (RESIN Technology)</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h4>Technical Specifications</h4>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Model</td>\r\\n<td>AS2.1</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Flow Rate</td>\r\\n<td>2.1 m3/h</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Output per Regeneration (at 200 ppm CaCO3)</td>\r\\n<td>6.25 m3</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Purple Resin Quantity</td>\r\\n<td>25 liters</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Coarse Silex</td>\r\\n<td>29 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Cabinet Salt Capacity (Max)</td>\r\\n<td>100 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Salt per Recharge</td>\r\\n<td>4 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Brine Volume</td>\r\\n<td>14 liters</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Brine Float Setting</td>\r\\n<td>105 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Process Valve</td>\r\\n<td>Fully Automatic Programmable</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Softener Vessel &amp; Brine Tank</td>\r\\n<td>FRP composite vessel tank &amp; HDPE brine tank</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Vessel Size</td>\r\\n<td>10\" dia. x 54\" Height, 2.5\" Top Opening</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Installation Footprint</td>\r\\n<td>6 x 6 sq. ft.</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td>Electric Supply</td>\r\\n<td>230 VAC, 6 Amp</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n&nbsp;\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "The all-new ZeroB Softener automatically converts hard water into soft, safe water, enhancing bathing, washing, and laundry while preventing scale and scum. Designed for easy installation, it features a robust automatic valve and proprietary purple food-grade resin, ensuring reliable performance and protection against spurious media for long-lasting quality.",
