    "summary": "The KENT AutoSoft 25L is an automatic whole-house water softener featuring 25 litres of resin capacity and 5-Step Automatic Regeneration Technology . It effectively removes hardness-causing minerals, prevents scale buildup, improves soap efficiency, protects appliances, and helps keep skin, hair, and clothes healthier.",
    "description": "<strong>KENT AutoSoft 25L Water Softener\r\\n\r\\n</strong>The <strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"101\">KENT AutoSoft 25L Water Softener</strong> is a fully automatic whole-house water softening system designed to convert hard water into soft water using an advanced ion-exchange process. Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"298\">25-litre high-capacity resin tank</strong> and <strong data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"347\">Automatic 5-Step Regeneration Technology</strong>, it efficiently removes hardness-causing calcium and magnesium ions without the use of harmful chemicals.\r\\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1912\">Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2480\">\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"pof2iw\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1956\">Automatic 5-Step Regeneration Technology</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"g5m6vd\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1995\">High-efficiency ion-exchange process</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1i19359\" data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2031\">Time-based automatic regeneration</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1h37vds\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2067\">25-litre high-capacity resin tank</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"3sbxd7\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2118\">Prevents scale formation in pipes and appliances</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"jz9rpt\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2174\">Protects washing machines, geysers, taps, and showers</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"11g0i2j\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2237\">Helps reduce skin dryness and hair fall caused by hard water</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"m9293a\" data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2275\">Improves soap and shampoo lathering</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"bunmfx\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2327\">Reduces detergent, shampoo, and water consumption</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1pay3fq\" data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2370\">Keeps clothes softer and prevents fading</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1i4kujt\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2404\">User-friendly LCD control panel</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"cgzv8s\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2440\">Easy installation and maintenance</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"cz41f2\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2480\">Chemical-free water softening process</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2485\" />\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgu054\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2514\">Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2532\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Specification</th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2543\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details</th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2583\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2582\">Brand</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2591\">KENT</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2620\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2604\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2603\">Model</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"md\">AutoSoft 25L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2675\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2639\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2638\">Application</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Whole-house hard water softening</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2695\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2694\">Product Code</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2705\" data-col-size=\"md\">111039</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2748\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2730\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2729\">Installation Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2748\" data-col-size=\"md\">Floor Standing</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2817\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2766\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2765\">Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2817\" data-col-size=\"md\">Ion-Exchange with Automatic 5-Step Regeneration</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2818\" data-end=\"2842\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2841\">Regeneration Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2866\">Time-Based Automatic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2904\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2891\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2890\">Maximum Flow Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2904\">3,000 LPH</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2924\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2923\">Resin Volume</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2937\" data-col-size=\"md\">25 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2955\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2940\" data-end=\"2954\">Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2964\">40 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3017\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2994\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2993\">Dimensions (L × W × H)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3017\">330 × 570 × 1120 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3043\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3042\">Input Power Supply</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3081\">Single Phase, 110–240V AC, 50–60Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3115\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3106\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3105\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3115\" data-col-size=\"md\">3.5 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "The <strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1452\">KENT AutoSoft 25L</strong> is an automatic whole-house water softener featuring <strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1537\">25 litres of resin capacity</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1586\">5-Step Automatic Regeneration Technology</strong>. It effectively removes hardness-causing minerals, prevents scale buildup, improves soap efficiency, protects appliances, and helps keep skin, hair, and clothes healthier. Its intelligent LCD control panel and time-based regeneration ensure hassle-free operation with a flow rate of up to <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1889\">3,000 LPH</strong>.",
