    "summary": "The KENT Automatic Iron Removal Filter – 100L is a high-capacity whole-house iron removal system designed to eliminate excess iron from raw water. With a 100L media capacity and 4000 LPH flow rate , it delivers a continuous supply of clean, iron-free water while protecting plumbing, appliances, and fixtures from rust a",
    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"668\">The <strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"95\">KENT Automatic Iron Removal Filter – 100L</strong> is a high-capacity whole-house filtration system designed to remove excess iron from raw water. With a <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"227\">100-litre media capacity</strong> and a <strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"265\">flow rate of up to 4000 LPH</strong>, it ensures a continuous supply of clean, iron-free water for homes, villas, apartments, and commercial establishments. The system helps prevent rust stains, protects plumbing and appliances from scaling, and improves overall water quality. Featuring a <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"548\">fully automatic operation</strong>, <strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"571\">LCD control panel</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"610\">compact floor-standing design</strong>, it offers reliable performance with minimal maintenance.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lxdw2p\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"687\">Best Features</h3>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"lkfrwy\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"783\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"720\">High Capacity Performance</strong> – 100L filtration media with a high flow rate of <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"782\">4000 LPH</strong>.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"kw1tjr\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"890\"><strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"812\">Efficient Iron Removal</strong> – Effectively removes excess iron from raw water for cleaner and safer usage.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"birlas\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"996\"><strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"916\">Protects Appliances</strong> – Prevents scaling and extends the lifespan of kitchen and bathroom appliances.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"6v4a33\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1077\"><strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1017\">Compact Design</strong> – Space-saving floor-standing design for easy installation.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1r54wuk\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1169\"><strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1101\">LCD Control Panel</strong> – User-friendly display for simple operation and system monitoring.</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"17v3f6d\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1288\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1201\">Fully Automatic Operation</strong> – Hassle-free functioning with automatic regeneration and minimal manual intervention.</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\" />\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cgu054\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1322\">Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1708\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1344\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1343\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1359\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1357\">Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1708\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1414\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1413\">Application</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1459\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable for removing iron from raw water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1489\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1479\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1478\">Product Code</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1489\">111163</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1510\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1509\">Mounting Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1528\">Floor Standing</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1558\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1545\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1544\">Flow Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1558\">4000 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1579\">Media Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1589\">100 L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1616\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1615\">Gravel Media Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1625\">10 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1643\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1642\">Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1655\">11.20 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1708\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1685\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1684\">Dimensions (L × W × H)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1708\" data-is-last-node=\"\">322 × 332 × 1384 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
