    "description": "<h6>Key Features</h6>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO | UV | UF | Alkaline</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: 15 Litres Per Hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>5 Micron Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD Imported Pump</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD RO Membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon 1100 IV</li>\r\\n \t<li>UVC LED 5W</li>\r\\n \t<li>UF Filter 4″</li>\r\\n \t<li>Bio AA+ Alkaline Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>Auto TDS Screen with TDS Display</li>\r\\n \t<li>Automatic TDS Adjuster</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Supply: 220V AC / DC 24V – 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Tank: 10 Litres</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable / Table Top</li>\r\\n \t<li>ABS Premium Grade Storage Tank and Cabinet Quality</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThe <strong>Kraft Auto TDS Water Purifier</strong> is an advanced purification system designed to deliver clean, healthy, and mineral-balanced drinking water for everyday household use. Powered by <strong>RO, UV, UF, and Alkaline purification technology</strong>, it effectively removes impurities, bacteria, and excess dissolved solids while enhancing water quality with essential minerals. With a <strong>purification capacity of 15 litres per hour</strong>, it is ideal for small to medium families.\r\\n\r\\nThe system includes a <strong>5-micron sediment filter</strong>, a <strong>100 GPD imported pump</strong>, and a <strong>100 GPD RO membrane</strong> to ensure consistent pressure and efficient filtration. <strong>Coconut shell activated carbon (1100 IV)</strong> improves taste and removes odors, while the <strong>5W UVC LED</strong> provides additional microbial safety. A <strong>Bio AA+ Alkaline filter</strong> enhances pH levels, supporting healthier hydration.\r\\n\r\\nFeaturing an <strong>auto TDS screen with real-time TDS display</strong> and an <strong>automatic TDS adjuster</strong>, the purifier intelligently maintains optimal mineral balance. With a <strong>10-litre storage tank</strong>, flexible <strong>wall-mount or table-top installation</strong>, and a durable <strong>ABS premium-grade cabinet</strong>, the Kraft Auto TDS offers smart functionality, reliability, and modern design in one compact unit.",
    "shortDescription": "<strong>Multi-purpose use:</strong> This water purifier best suits locations where raw water quality (TDS) fluctuates. It maintains drinking water TDS and taste consistently and automatically.\r\\n\r\\n<strong>Dimensions:</strong> H – 20″, D – 9″, W – 15″",
