    "description": "<h6>Key Features</h6>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO | UV | UF | Alkaline</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: 15 Litres Per Hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>5 Micron Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD Imported Pump</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD RO Membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon 1100 IV</li>\r\\n \t<li>UVC LED with SS Barrel</li>\r\\n \t<li>UF Filter 4″</li>\r\\n \t<li>BIO AA+ Alkaline Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>Manual TDS Adjuster</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Supply: 220V AC / DC 24V – 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>4 Gallon Pressure Tank</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Tank: 14 Litres</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable / Table Top</li>\r\\n \t<li>ABS Premium Grade Storage Tank and Cabinet Quality</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThe <strong>Under-the-Sink RO UV UF Alkaline Water Purifier</strong> is specially designed for modern homes, delivering <strong>pure, mineral-rich drinking water</strong> while saving valuable kitchen space. Installed neatly below your sink, it keeps your countertop clean and clutter-free without compromising on performance.\r\\n\r\\nWith a <strong>purification capacity of 15 litres per hour</strong>, this system ensures a steady supply of safe water for your family. It features a <strong>5 micron sediment filter</strong> to remove dust and rust particles, along with a powerful <strong>100 GPD imported pump</strong> and <strong>100 GPD RO membrane</strong> to effectively reduce <strong>TDS, heavy metals, and dissolved impurities</strong>. The <strong>coconut shell activated carbon (1100 IV)</strong> enhances taste and removes chlorine and odor.\r\\n\r\\nFor advanced protection, the purifier includes a <strong>UVC LED with SS barrel</strong> and a <strong>4-inch UF filter</strong> for added microbial safety. The <strong>BIO AA+ Alkaline filter</strong> enriches water with essential minerals and balances pH levels. A <strong>manual TDS adjuster</strong> allows customized mineral control. It comes with a <strong>4-gallon pressure tank</strong> and <strong>14-litre storage capacity</strong>, powered by a <strong>220V AC / 24V DC – 30W SMPS supply</strong>, and built with <strong>ABS premium-grade storage tank and cabinet quality</strong> for long-lasting durability.",
    "shortDescription": "Under-the-sink RO UV UF Alkaline purifier delivers clean, mineral-rich water with advanced filtration while saving kitchen space and maintaining a neat, clutter-free countertop.",
