    "summary": "Experience the perfect combination of purity, convenience, and performance with the WAVE 4G ACE (HOT & COLD) . Designed for modern homes, this advanced domestic water purifier delivers safe, crystal-clear drinking water with the convenience of Hot, Cold, and Normal water at the touch of a button. Its premium purificati",
    "description": "<h2>Premium RO Water Purifier with Hot, Cold &amp; Normal Water</h2>\r\\n<h3>About the Product</h3>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <strong>WAVE 4G ACE (HOT &amp; COLD)</strong> is a premium RO water purifier designed to provide <strong>safe, pure, and healthy drinking water</strong> for your family. Built with advanced multi-stage purification technology, it effectively removes dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, chemicals, and unpleasant odours from municipal, borewell, and tanker water.</p>\r\\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">With the convenience of <strong>Hot, Cold, and Normal water</strong> from a single unit, the WAVE 4G ACE is perfect for modern homes and offices. Its stylish design, durable construction, and energy-efficient performance make it an ideal choice for everyday use.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div contenteditable=\"false\">\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n \t<li>Advanced <strong>RO Purification Technology</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Hot, Cold &amp; Normal</strong> Water Dispensing</li>\r\\n \t<li>Removes <strong>Bacteria, Viruses, Heavy Metals &amp; Dissolved Impurities</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for <strong>Municipal, Borewell &amp; Tanker Water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Fresh, Great-Tasting &amp; Healthy Drinking Water</li>\r\\n \t<li>Elegant Premium Design</li>\r\\n \t<li>Low Power Consumption</li>\r\\n \t<li>Smart &amp; User-Friendly Operation</li>\r\\n \t<li>Durable Components for Long Service Life</li>\r\\n \t<li>Ideal for Homes &amp; Small Offices</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<div contenteditable=\"false\">\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n<h2>Why Choose WAVE 4G ACE?</h2>\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n \t<li>Safe drinking water for your entire family</li>\r\\n \t<li>Instant hot water for tea, coffee, and baby food</li>\r\\n \t<li>Chilled water anytime without refrigeration</li>\r\\n \t<li>Multi-stage purification for superior water quality</li>\r\\n \t<li>Modern design that enhances your kitchen interior</li>\r\\n \t<li>Reliable performance with minimal maintenance</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<div contenteditable=\"false\">\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n<h2>Applications</h2>\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n \t<li>Homes</li>\r\\n \t<li>Apartments</li>\r\\n \t<li>Villas</li>\r\\n \t<li>Offices</li>\r\\n \t<li>Clinics</li>\r\\n \t<li>Retail Stores</li>\r\\n \t<li>Small Commercial Spaces</li>\r\\n</ul>",
    "shortDescription": "<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Experience the perfect combination of purity, convenience, and performance with the <strong>WAVE 4G ACE (HOT &amp; COLD)</strong>. Designed for modern homes, this advanced domestic water purifier delivers safe, crystal-clear drinking water with the convenience of <strong>Hot, Cold, and Normal</strong> water at the touch of a button. Its premium purification technology ensures every glass is clean, healthy, and refreshing for your entire family.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3>Highlights</h3>\r\\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\\n \t<li><strong>High-Efficiency Multi-Stage Purification</strong> for superior removal of impurities and contaminants.</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Retains Essential Minerals</strong> to deliver naturally fresh, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water.</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Instant Hot, Cold &amp; Normal Water</strong> for everyday convenience.</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Robust Food-Grade Construction</strong> for long-lasting durability and hygienic performance.</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Elegant Modern Design</strong> that complements contemporary kitchens and living spaces.</li>\r\\n</ul>",
