    "description": "<h6>Key Features</h6>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO Water Purification System</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: 100 Litres Per Hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>3 In 1 Sediment | Carbon | Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>400 GPD Imported Pump × 2</li>\r\\n \t<li>400 GPD RO Membrane × 2</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon 1100 IV</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Supply: 220V AC / DC 3 Amps × 2</li>\r\\n \t<li>Connect with any External Tank or Water Cooler</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable / Table Top Installation</li>\r\\n \t<li>ABS Premium Grade Storage Tank and Cabinet Quality</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThe <strong>Compact 100 LPH Commercial RO</strong> is a powerful and efficient high-capacity purification system designed for commercial environments requiring continuous and large-volume water supply. With a purification capacity of <strong>100 litres per hour</strong>, it ensures reliable performance throughout the day.\r\\n\r\\nThis system features advanced <strong>RO water purification technology</strong> that effectively removes dissolved impurities, heavy metals, chemicals, and harmful contaminants. The <strong>3-in-1 Sediment | Carbon | Sediment filter</strong> provides superior pre-filtration, removing dust, rust, and chlorine while protecting internal components and extending membrane life.\r\\n\r\\nEquipped with <strong>dual 400 GPD imported pumps</strong> and <strong>dual 400 GPD RO membranes</strong>, the unit delivers enhanced pressure, faster purification, and consistent output. The <strong>coconut shell activated carbon (1100 IV)</strong> improves taste and removes unpleasant odors, ensuring clean and fresh drinking water. The system operates on <strong>220V AC / 24V DC – 3 Amps SMPS supply × 2</strong>, providing stable and energy-efficient performance. It can be easily <strong>connected with any external storage tank or water cooler</strong>, making it highly flexible for various commercial setups. Designed for durability, it supports <strong>wall mountable or table top installation</strong> and is built with <strong>ABS premium-grade cabinet quality</strong>.",
