    "description": "<table class=\"spec-table\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Code</th>\r\\n<td>1772WB</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Model</th>\r\\n<td>CHROME CURVE PRO</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Pump</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome 100 GPD Pump</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Membrane</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome 100 GPD Membrane</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Colour</th>\r\\n<td>White Black</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Application</th>\r\\n<td>Suitable for Brackish Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Filters</th>\r\\n<td>Prefilter Set, Inline Sediment, Inline Pre Carbon, Inline Copper Filter, UF, UV LED</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Float</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>FR</th>\r\\n<td>KFL</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Inline Set</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Input Voltage</th>\r\\n<td>100–300V AC (50Hz)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Installation</th>\r\\n<td>Counter Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Maximum Operating TDS</th>\r\\n<td>Up to 2000 PPM</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Membrane Type</th>\r\\n<td>Thin Film Composite (TFC)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Minimum Inlet Pressure / Temperature</th>\r\\n<td>0.3 kg/cm², 10°C</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Operating Voltage</th>\r\\n<td>24V DC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td>480 (H) × 215 (W) × 360 (L) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Packing Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td>650 (H) × 290 (W) × 405 (L) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Purification Capacity</th>\r\\n<td>12 Litres Per Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Recovery Rate</th>\r\\n<td>More than 40% at 27°C ± 2°C</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>SMPS</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Solenoid Valve</th>\r\\n<td>Chrome</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n<td>6.5 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Technology</th>\r\\n<td>Reverse Osmosis (RO) System</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n<td>50 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Tubing</th>\r\\n<td>5 Metres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>System Weight</th>\r\\n<td>7.30 kg (Approx.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Country of Origin</th>\r\\n<td>India</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
    "shortDescription": "The Chrome Curve Pro RO + UV Water Purifier is designed to deliver clean, healthy, and mineral-rich drinking water for households using brackish water. Featuring advanced RO + UV purification with a Copper Filter, UF Filter, and UV LED technology, it effectively removes impurities, bacteria, viruses, and excess TDS while improving the quality and taste of water. Its premium White &amp; Black finish, compact 6.5-litre storage tank, and powerful 100 GPD pump ensure reliable everyday performance.",
