    "summary": "\\n \\nKENT Pearl IoT is the most advanced RO water purifier that uses multiple purification processes of RO+UV+UF+Alkaline+Copper+TDS Control with advanced IoT intelligence that offers real-time display of water quality and filter life, along with timely notifications, automatic service call registration in case of any",
    "description": "<h2>Best Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Most Advanced RO Water Purifier with RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control Purification</li>\r\\n \t<li>IoT-Powered Smart Monitoring through Mobile App</li>\r\\n \t<li>Makes drinking water 100% pure</li>\r\\n \t<li>Retains essential natural minerals in purified water</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purified water enriched with the goodness of Active Copper</li>\r\\n \t<li>Provides alkaline water with pH 8.0–9.5</li>\r\\n \t<li>Digital display for real-time purity and performance monitoring</li>\r\\n \t<li>11L storage capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li>High purification capacity of 20 L/hr</li>\r\\n \t<li>Transparent detachable storage tank for easy cleaning</li>\r\\n \t<li>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</li>\r\\n \t<li>Trusted by about 1 crore satisfied consumers across India</li>\r\\n \t<li>International Quality Certifications: NSF &amp; ISI</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2>About Product</h2>\r\\nThis advanced KENT RO Water Purifier features a powerful\r\\n<strong>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control</strong> purification\r\\nsystem that removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, heavy metals, and dissolved\r\\nimpurities while retaining essential natural minerals. It delivers 100% pure,\r\\nsafe, and healthy drinking water that meets IS:10500 drinking water standards.\r\\n\r\\nEquipped with <strong>IoT-powered smart monitoring</strong>, the purifier\r\\nallows you to monitor water quality, filter life, service alerts, and system\r\\nperformance directly from your smartphone, providing complete control anytime,\r\\nanywhere.\r\\n\r\\nThe advanced <strong>TDS Control</strong> system preserves essential minerals,\r\\nwhile the <strong>Alkaline Technology</strong> enriches water with a pH level\r\\nbetween 8.0 and 9.5 to support better hydration and overall wellness. The\r\\n<strong>Active Copper Technology</strong> further enhances the purified water\r\\nwith the goodness of copper.\r\\n\r\\nWith a purification capacity of up to <strong>20 litres per hour</strong> and\r\\na large <strong>11 litre transparent detachable storage tank</strong>, it\r\\nensures a continuous supply of clean water and makes tank cleaning easy. The\r\\ndigital display provides real-time information about water purity, filter\r\\nstatus, and purifier performance.\r\\n\r\\nBacked by a <strong>1 Year Warranty</strong> and <strong>3 Years Free\r\\nService</strong>, KENT continues to be trusted by more than 1 crore satisfied\r\\nconsumers across India and is certified by both <strong>NSF</strong> and\r\\n<strong>ISI</strong> for quality, safety, and reliability.\r\\n\r\\n&nbsp;\r\\n<h2>Technical Details</h2>\r\\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Application</th>\r\\n<td>Suitable for purification of Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Code</th>\r\\n<td>111175</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Mounting</th>\r\\n<td>Wall Mounting</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Body Material</th>\r\\n<td>ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Purification Capacity</th>\r\\n<td>20 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n<td>11L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net Weight</th>\r\\n<td>9.80 Kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td>380 (L) × 330 (W) × 470 (H) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Input Power Supply</th>\r\\n<td>Single Phase 250V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n<td>60W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"kent-short-description\">\r\\n\r\\nKENT Pearl IoT is the most advanced RO water purifier that uses multiple purification processes of RO+UV+UF+Alkaline+Copper+TDS Control with advanced IoT intelligence that offers real-time display of water quality and filter life, along with timely notifications, automatic service call registration in case of any fault, and easy access to service and parts replacement history.It retains essential natural minerals in water with KENT’s Mineral RO™ technology and enhances the purified water’s pH from 8–9. It comes with Goodness of Copper and is ideal for purifying brackish, tap, and municipal water.\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
