    "summary": "\\n KENT Sterling IoT RO Water Purifier \\n The KENT Sterling IoT RO Water Purifier is a premium under-the-counter water purification system designed for modern modular kitchens. Featuring an advanced RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control purification process, it effectively removes dissolved impurities, harmful",
