    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"kent-short-description\">\r\\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fmdpyq\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"39\">KENT Sterling IoT RO Water Purifier</h3>\r\\n<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"408\">The <strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"84\">KENT Sterling IoT RO Water Purifier</strong> is a premium under-the-counter water purification system designed for modern modular kitchens. Featuring an advanced <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"252\">RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control</strong> purification process, it effectively removes dissolved impurities, harmful chemicals, bacteria, and viruses while ensuring safe and healthy drinking water.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"798\">Equipped with <strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"451\">advanced IoT technology</strong>, the purifier offers real-time monitoring of water quality, filter life, and RO flow rate through a digital display and mobile connectivity. It also sends timely filter replacement alerts, automatically registers service requests in case of faults, and maintains a complete service and spare parts replacement history for hassle-free maintenance.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"1138\">Powered by <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"844\">KENT’s Mineral RO™ Technology</strong>, it retains essential natural minerals in purified water, while <strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"937\">Active Copper Technology</strong> enriches the water with the natural benefits of copper. The integrated alkaline enhancement raises the pH level of purified water to <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1082\">8.0–9.5</strong>, providing healthier and better-tasting drinking water.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1463\">Its <strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1178\">under-the-counter installation</strong> keeps your kitchen clutter-free while the separate faucet delivers purified water conveniently. With a <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1327\">6-litre built-in hydrostatic storage tank</strong> and a purification capacity of <strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1381\">20 litres per hour</strong>, the KENT Sterling IoT ensures a continuous supply of pure water for your family.</p>\r\\n\r\\n\r\\n<hr data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1468\" />\r\\n\r\\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1485\">Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"z8lj9r\" data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1572\">Advanced <strong data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1548\">RO + UV + UF + Alkaline + Copper + TDS Control</strong> purification technology</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"k8zkuw\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1648\">Removes dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, and harmful contaminants</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1qwcsm1\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1711\"><strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1683\">IoT-enabled smart monitoring</strong> through mobile connectivity</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"w911k1\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1783\">Real-time display of <strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1783\">water quality, filter life, and RO flow rate</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"11t8y1s\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1858\">Automatic <strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1828\">service request registration</strong> and filter replacement alerts</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1ccc6ly\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1910\">Digital display for purity and system performance</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"50763f\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1974\"><strong data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1939\">Mineral RO™ Technology</strong> retains essential natural minerals</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"fiyaek\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2050\"><strong data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2005\">Active Copper Technology</strong> enriches purified water with copper benefits</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1f5i0of\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2096\">Delivers <strong data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2096\">alkaline water with pH 8.0–9.5</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1et75uo\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2161\">Space-saving <strong data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2133\">under-the-counter</strong> design for modular kitchens</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"13yg1hc\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2209\">Built-in <strong data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2209\">6-litre hydrostatic storage tank</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"9vlc16\" data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2259\">Purification capacity of <strong data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2259\">20 litres per hour</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"1i0y8u8\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2319\"><strong data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2289\">1-Year Product Warranty</strong> with <strong data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2319\">3 Years Free Service</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"uci8t7\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2382\">Trusted by <strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2369\">over 1 crore satisfied consumers</strong> across India</li>\r\\n \t<li data-section-id=\"svcqvn\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2442\">Certified for quality with <strong data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2442\">NSF and ISI certifications</strong></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</div>",
