    "summary": "Zenpure Fonix RO+UV+UF+Copper Alkaline Water Purifier features advanced multi-stage purification with RO, UV, UF, Copper, and Alkaline technology to deliver safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. Equipped with a 12L storage tank, it is ideal for homes and offices. Its sleek wall-mountable design, energy-effic",
    "description": "<div class=\"product-description\">\r\\n\r\\n  <h2>Zenpure Fonix RO+UV+UF+Copper Alkaline Water Purifier</h2>\r\\n\r\\n  <p>\r\\n    <strong>12L Storage Tank | RO + UV + UF + Copper + Alkaline | Multi-Stage Purification | 5 Years Warranty</strong>\r\\n  </p>\r\\n\r\\n  <p>\r\\n    Experience pure, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water with the\r\\n    <strong>Zenpure Fonix RO+UV+UF+Copper Alkaline Water Purifier</strong>.\r\\n    Designed for modern Indian homes, it features advanced multi-stage purification\r\\n    technology that removes impurities, bacteria, viruses, and excess TDS while\r\\n    enriching water with essential minerals for healthier hydration.\r\\n  </p>\r\\n\r\\n  <h3>Key Features</h3>\r\\n\r\\n  <ul>\r\\n    <li><strong>12L Large Storage Tank:</strong> Ideal for medium and large families, ensuring an uninterrupted supply of purified water.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>RO + UV + UF + Copper + Alkaline Purification:</strong> Advanced multi-stage filtration removes dissolved impurities, harmful chemicals, bacteria, viruses, and excess TDS.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>Copper &amp; Alkaline Enrichment:</strong> Infuses water with copper and helps maintain balanced alkaline pH for improved taste and refreshing drinking water.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>Multi-Stage Purification:</strong> Delivers safe, clean, mineral-rich drinking water suitable for everyday use.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>Elegant &amp; Durable Design:</strong> Stylish wall-mountable purifier that complements modern kitchen interiors.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>Energy Efficient:</strong> Designed for reliable performance with low power consumption and minimal maintenance.</li>\r\\n\r\\n    <li><strong>5 Years Warranty:</strong> Includes 1 Year Product Warranty + 4 Years Extended Service Support (Terms &amp; Conditions apply).</li>\r\\n  </ul>\r\\n\r\\n  <h3>Package Contents</h3>\r\\n\r\\n  <ul>\r\\n    <li>Zenpure Fonix Water Purifier</li>\r\\n    <li>Installation Kit</li>\r\\n    <li>User Manual</li>\r\\n    <li>Warranty Card</li>\r\\n  </ul>\r\\n\r\\n  <h3>Ideal For</h3>\r\\n\r\\n  <p>\r\\n    Perfect for <strong>Homes, Apartments, Offices, and Small Commercial Establishments</strong>,\r\\n    providing safe, purified, and mineral-enriched drinking water every day.\r\\n  </p>\r\\n\r\\n  <h3>Why Choose Zenpure Fonix?</h3>\r\\n\r\\n  <p>\r\\n    Combining advanced RO, UV, UF, Copper, and Alkaline purification technologies,\r\\n    the Zenpure Fonix delivers safe, fresh, and great-tasting water while maintaining\r\\n    essential minerals for your family's daily hydration needs.\r\\n  </p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "Zenpure Fonix RO+UV+UF+Copper Alkaline Water Purifier features advanced multi-stage purification with RO, UV, UF, Copper, and Alkaline technology to deliver safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. Equipped with a 12L storage tank, it is ideal for homes and offices. Its sleek wall-mountable design, energy-efficient operation, and 5-year warranty make it a reliable choice for everyday purification.",
