    "summary": "Advanced RO alkaline purifier with hot water, digital TDS display, and 10L storage.",
    "description": "<h6>Key Features</h6>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO | Alkaline</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: 15 Litres Per Hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>5 Micron Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD Imported Pump</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD RO Membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon 1100 IV</li>\r\\n \t<li>Digital Screen with TDS Monitoring</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Supply: 220V AC / DC 24V – 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Power Consumption: RO 30W, Heater 550W (When In Use)</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Tank (Normal): 10 Litres</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Tank (Hot): 1 Litre</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable / Table Top</li>\r\\n \t<li>ABS Premium Grade Cabinet Quality</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThe <strong>Kraft Hot &amp; Normal Alkaline Water Purifier</strong> is a reliable and efficient solution designed to provide safe, mineral-enriched drinking water for your home. Powered by advanced <strong>RO + Alkaline purification technology</strong>, it effectively removes dissolved impurities while restoring essential minerals to maintain balanced and healthy drinking water.\r\\n\r\\nWith a <strong>purification capacity of 15 litres per hour</strong>, this purifier ensures a continuous supply of clean water for daily household needs. It features a <strong>5 micron sediment filter</strong> that removes dust, rust, and suspended particles, protecting internal components and enhancing performance. The powerful <strong>100 GPD imported pump</strong> and <strong>100 GPD RO membrane</strong> efficiently reduce high TDS, heavy metals, and harmful contaminants. The <strong>coconut shell activated carbon (1100 IV)</strong> improves taste, eliminates chlorine, and removes unpleasant odors.\r\\n\r\\nEquipped with a <strong>digital screen with TDS monitoring</strong>, the purifier allows you to easily track water quality in real time. The hot water functionality provides instant access to heated water, making it convenient for beverages and cooking. Power consumption includes <strong>RO 30W</strong> and <strong>Heater 550W (when in use)</strong>, ensuring efficient performance. The purifier offers a storage capacity of <strong>10 litres normal water</strong> and <strong>1 litre hot water</strong>, supports <strong>wall mountable or table top installation</strong>, and is built with durable <strong>ABS premium-grade cabinet quality</strong>.",
    "shortDescription": "Advanced RO alkaline purifier with hot water, digital TDS display, and 10L storage.",
