    "gallery": [
      "https://aakashaquatech.in/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Red-2.webp"
    ],
    "summary": "The 5G PRO Hot, Ambient & Cold Alkaline Water Purifier is a premium RO water purifier designed to deliver safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water with the convenience of instant hot, ambient, and cold water. Featuring advanced RO + UV + UF + Alkaline purification, a 15 LPH purification capacity, 5W UVC LED in-t",
    "description": "<h2><strong>5G PRO Hot, Ambient &amp; Cold Alkaline Water Purifier</strong></h2>\r\\n<h3><strong>Key Features</strong></h3>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO | UV | UF | Alkaline Multi-Stage Purification</li>\r\\n \t<li>Hot, Ambient &amp; Cold Water Dispensing</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: <strong>15 Litres Per Hour</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for Raw Water TDS up to <strong>3000 PPM</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>5 Micron Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD Imported Booster Pump</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD RO Membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon (1100 IV)</li>\r\\n \t<li>5W UVC LED In-Tank Sterilization</li>\r\\n \t<li>4\" UF Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>Bio AA+ Alkaline Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>Vegetable Detoxifier</li>\r\\n \t<li>Intelligent Touch Panel with Real-Time TDS Monitoring</li>\r\\n \t<li>Manual TDS Adjuster</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Power Supply: 220V AC / DC 24V – 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Power Consumption:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO: 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Heater: 550W (During Heating)</li>\r\\n \t<li>Cooling: 60W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Vegetable Detoxifier: 5W</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Capacity:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Ambient Water: <strong>4 Litres</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Hot Water: <strong>1 Litre</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Cold Water: <strong>0.8 Litre</strong></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable &amp; Table Top Installation</li>\r\\n \t<li>Premium ABS Food-Grade Cabinet with Elegant Glass Finish</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n<h1>Product Description</h1>\r\\nThe <strong>5G PRO Hot, Ambient &amp; Cold Alkaline Water Purifier</strong> is a premium, all-in-one water purification system designed to deliver safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water with the convenience of instant hot, ambient, and cold water. Combining advanced purification technology with a sleek glass-finish design and an intelligent touch panel, this purifier is the perfect addition to modern homes, offices, and commercial spaces.\r\\n\r\\nPowered by an advanced <strong>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline</strong> multi-stage purification process, the purifier effectively removes excess Total Dissolved Solids (TDS), dissolved salts, bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, harmful chemicals, pesticides, and other contaminants while retaining essential minerals for healthier drinking water. It is suitable for treating raw water with TDS levels up to <strong>3000 PPM</strong> and delivers a purification capacity of <strong>15 litres per hour</strong>, ensuring a continuous supply of purified water for your family.\r\\n\r\\nThe purification system includes a <strong>5 Micron Sediment Filter</strong> that removes dust, sand, rust, and suspended particles, protecting the internal filters and extending their life. A <strong>100 GPD Imported Booster Pump</strong> ensures consistent water pressure for efficient purification, while the <strong>100 GPD RO Membrane</strong> significantly reduces dissolved impurities and excess TDS.\r\\n\r\\nTo further enhance water quality, the purifier features <strong>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon (1100 IV)</strong>, which effectively removes chlorine, unpleasant taste, odor, and organic impurities, delivering fresh and naturally pleasant-tasting drinking water. The <strong>4-inch UF Filter</strong> provides an additional layer of filtration by removing fine suspended particles and microorganisms without affecting beneficial minerals.\r\\n\r\\nFor superior microbial protection, the purifier is equipped with a powerful <strong>5W UVC LED In-Tank Sterilization System</strong>, which continuously disinfects stored water and prevents bacterial growth inside the storage tank, ensuring every glass of water remains hygienic even after storage.\r\\n\r\\nThe integrated <strong>Bio AA+ Alkaline Filter</strong> enriches purified water with essential minerals such as calcium and magnesium while balancing the pH level to produce healthy alkaline drinking water that supports better hydration and improved taste.\r\\n\r\\nOne of the standout features of the 5G PRO is its <strong>Vegetable Detoxifier</strong>, which helps remove pesticide residues, harmful chemicals, and surface contaminants from fruits and vegetables, providing an additional level of protection for your family's daily food preparation.\r\\n\r\\nThe purifier is equipped with a modern <strong>Touch Panel</strong> featuring <strong>Real-Time TDS Monitoring</strong>, allowing users to easily monitor the quality of purified water. A <strong>Manual TDS Adjuster</strong> enables precise control over mineral retention, allowing you to customize the taste and mineral content according to your local water conditions and personal preference.\r\\n\r\\nDesigned for maximum convenience, the purifier includes separate storage tanks for multiple temperature options:\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li><strong>4 Litres Ambient Water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>1 Litre Hot Water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>0.8 Litre Cold Water</strong></li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nWhether you need chilled drinking water during summer, hot water for tea, coffee, or instant foods, or ambient water for everyday hydration, the 5G PRO delivers water instantly at your preferred temperature.\r\\n\r\\nThe purifier operates using an energy-efficient <strong>SMPS Power Supply (220V AC / 24V DC – 30W)</strong>. Power consumption is optimized with <strong>30W</strong> during RO purification, <strong>550W</strong> while heating, <strong>60W</strong> during cooling, and only <strong>5W</strong> for the Vegetable Detoxifier, ensuring reliable performance with efficient energy usage.\r\\n\r\\nConstructed with a <strong>Premium ABS Food-Grade Cabinet</strong> and an elegant tempered glass front panel, the 5G PRO offers excellent durability, easy maintenance, and a sophisticated appearance that complements any modern kitchen or workspace. Its versatile <strong>Wall Mountable</strong> and <strong>Table Top</strong> installation options provide flexibility to suit different spaces and user requirements.\r\\n\r\\nCombining intelligent technology, multi-stage purification, alkaline mineral enhancement, hot and cold dispensing, UVC in-tank protection, and a premium aesthetic design, the <strong>5G PRO Hot, Ambient &amp; Cold Alkaline Water Purifier</strong>delivers a complete drinking water solution for families seeking safety, convenience, performance, and style.",
    "shortDescription": "The <strong data-start=\"27\" data-end=\"81\">5G PRO Hot, Ambient &amp; Cold Alkaline Water Purifier</strong> is a premium RO water purifier designed to deliver safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water with the convenience of instant hot, ambient, and cold water. Featuring advanced <strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\"289\">RO + UV + UF + Alkaline</strong> purification, a <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"316\">15 LPH</strong> purification capacity, <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"376\">5W UVC LED in-tank sterilization</strong>, <strong data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"406\">real-time TDS monitoring</strong>, <strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"433\">manual TDS adjustment</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"465\">vegetable detoxifier</strong>, it ensures superior water quality for your family. With <strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"537\">4L ambient</strong>, <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"549\">1L hot</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"568\">0.8L cold</strong> storage tanks, an elegant glass-finish touch panel, and wall-mount or tabletop installation, the 5G PRO is the perfect combination of performance, convenience, and modern design.",
