    "description": "<h6>Key Features</h6>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>RO | UV | UF | Alkaline</li>\r\\n \t<li>Purification Capacity: 15 Litres Per Hour</li>\r\\n \t<li>5 Micron Sediment Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD Imported Pump</li>\r\\n \t<li>100 GPD RO Membrane</li>\r\\n \t<li>Coconut Shell Activated Carbon 1100 IV</li>\r\\n \t<li>UVC LED 5W In Tank</li>\r\\n \t<li>UF Filter 4″</li>\r\\n \t<li>BIO AA+ Alkaline Filter</li>\r\\n \t<li>Digital LED Screen to Monitor Machine Status</li>\r\\n \t<li>Manual TDS Adjuster</li>\r\\n \t<li>SMPS Supply: 220V AC / DC 24V – 30W</li>\r\\n \t<li>Water Storage Tank: 10 Litres</li>\r\\n \t<li>Wall Mountable / Table Top</li>\r\\n \t<li>ABS Premium Grade Storage Tank and Cabinet Quality</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\nThis <strong>RO + UV + UF + Alkaline Water Purifier</strong> is designed to provide <strong>advanced multi-stage purification</strong> for safe, healthy, and mineral-rich drinking water. With a purification capacity of <strong>15 litres per hour</strong>, it is ideal for homes, ensuring a continuous supply of clean water.\r\\n\r\\nThe system begins with a <strong>5 micron sediment filter</strong> that removes dust, sand, and rust particles. A powerful <strong>100 GPD imported pump</strong> combined with a <strong>100 GPD RO membrane</strong> effectively reduces <strong>TDS, heavy metals, chemicals, and dissolved impurities</strong>. The <strong>coconut shell activated carbon (1100 IV)</strong> enhances water taste and removes odor and chlorine.\r\\n\r\\nFor added safety, a <strong>5W UVC LED in tank</strong> prevents bacterial growth in stored water, while the <strong>4-inch UF filter</strong> provides an additional layer of fine filtration. The <strong>BIO AA+ Alkaline filter</strong> enriches water with essential minerals and helps balance pH levels, promoting healthier hydration. The purifier features a <strong>digital LED screen</strong> to monitor machine status for easy operation and maintenance. A <strong>manual TDS adjuster</strong> allows you to control mineral retention based on input water quality. It includes a <strong>10-litre ABS food-grade storage tank</strong>, is <strong>wall mountable or table top</strong>, and operates efficiently with a <strong>220V AC / 24V DC – 30W SMPS power supply</strong>.",
