    "description": "<h2>Best Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li>Multiple Purification Process of RO + UF + TDS Control</li>\r\\n \t<li>Makes drinking water 100% pure</li>\r\\n \t<li>Retains essential natural minerals in purified water</li>\r\\n \t<li>UV LED light keeps purified water pure in the tank</li>\r\\n \t<li>Gives 20 L/hr purified water</li>\r\\n \t<li>8L storage capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</li>\r\\n \t<li>Trusted by about 1 crore satisfied consumers across India</li>\r\\n \t<li>International Quality Certifications: NSF &amp; ISI</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n<h2>Product Description</h2>\r\\nThe multiple purification process of RO + UF + TDS Control makes water 100% pure.\r\\nKENT Elegant RO water purifier removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, and dissolved impurities\r\\nsuch as arsenic, rust, pesticides, and fluorides to provide pure and healthy drinking water\r\\nthat meets IS:10500 drinking water standards.\r\\n\r\\nWith a high purification capacity of up to 20 litres per hour and an 8 litre storage tank,\r\\nit ensures a continuous supply of purified water even during power cuts.\r\\n\r\\nThe TDS control system helps maintain the desired TDS level and retains essential natural\r\\nminerals in purified water. The UV LED light in the storage tank keeps stored water pure\r\\nand prevents bacterial growth.\r\\n<h2>Technical Details</h2>\r\\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"10\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Application</th>\r\\n<td>Suitable for purification of Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Product Code</th>\r\\n<td>111097</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Mounting</th>\r\\n<td>Wall Mounting</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Body Material</th>\r\\n<td>ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Purification Product Rate</th>\r\\n<td>20 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n<td>8L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Net Weight</th>\r\\n<td>6.62 Kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td>340 (L) × 265 (W) × 505 (H) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Input Power Supply</th>\r\\n<td>Single Phase 100-250V AC, 50-60 Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th>Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n<td>60W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
