    "summary": "KENT Crown Plus-B uses an advanced RO + UV + UF + Copper + TDS Control purification process to remove dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, and harmful contaminants while retaining essential natural minerals through KENT's Mineral RO™ Technology . It enriches purified water with the goodness of active copper for hea",
    "description": "<h2>KENT Crown Plus-B – Key Features</h2>\r\\n<ul>\r\\n \t<li><strong>RO + UV + UF + Copper + TDS Control</strong> Multiple Purification Technology</li>\r\\n \t<li>Makes <strong>100% Pure &amp; Safe Drinking Water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>20 LPH</strong> High Purification Capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>11 Litres</strong> Storage Capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Retains Essential Natural Minerals</strong> with TDS Control</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>Active Copper Technology</strong> for healthier drinking water</li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>UV LED Storage Tank</strong> keeps stored water germ-free for longer</li>\r\\n \t<li>Suitable for <strong>Brackish, Tap &amp; Municipal Water</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li><strong>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</strong></li>\r\\n \t<li>Trusted by <strong>1 Crore+ Satisfied Customers</strong> across India</li>\r\\n \t<li>Certified with <strong>NSF &amp; BIS (ISI)</strong> Quality Standards</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Product Description</h2>\r\\n<strong>KENT Crown Plus-B</strong> is an advanced water purifier featuring <strong>RO + UV + UF + Copper + TDS Control</strong> technology to deliver <strong>100% pure, safe, and healthy drinking water</strong>. It effectively removes bacteria, viruses, dissolved impurities, harmful chemicals, arsenic, pesticides, rust, and fluorides while retaining essential natural minerals for better taste and health.\r\\n\r\\nWith a purification capacity of <strong>20 litres per hour</strong> and a large <strong>11-litre storage tank</strong>, it ensures an uninterrupted supply of purified water even during power cuts. The built-in <strong>Active Copper Technology</strong> enriches the purified water with copper, while the <strong>UV LED light</strong> continuously disinfects the stored water, preventing bacterial growth and maintaining freshness.\r\\n\r\\nDesigned for <strong>brackish, tap, and municipal corporation water</strong>, KENT Crown Plus-B is built with durable <strong>ABS food-grade plastic</strong> and offers reliable performance backed by <strong>1 year warranty and 3 years free service</strong>. Trusted by over <strong>1 crore customers</strong>, KENT water purifiers are certified by <strong>BIS (ISI)</strong> and <strong>NSF</strong>, ensuring world-class quality and safety.\r\\n\r\\n<hr />\r\\n\r\\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\\n<table>\r\\n<thead>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th><strong>Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\\n<td>KENT Crown Plus-B</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Product Code</strong></td>\r\\n<td>111154B</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td>RO + UV + UF + Copper + TDS Control</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Application</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Purification Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td>20 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td>11 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Mounting Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Wall Mount</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Body Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td>ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Dimensions (L × W × H)</strong></td>\r\\n<td>390 × 280 × 545 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td>8.5 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Input Power Supply</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Single Phase 100–250V AC, 50–60Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td>60 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Warranty</strong></td>\r\\n<td>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
    "shortDescription": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"23\" data-end=\"366\">KENT Crown Plus-B uses an advanced <strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"97\">RO + UV + UF + Copper + TDS Control</strong> purification process to remove dissolved impurities, bacteria, viruses, and harmful contaminants while retaining essential natural minerals through <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"279\">KENT's Mineral RO™ Technology</strong>. It enriches purified water with the goodness of active copper for healthier drinking.</p>\r\\n<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"771\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The purifier features a <strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"432\">UV LED light inside the storage tank</strong>, which helps keep the stored water pure for a longer duration. Suitable for <strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"556\">brackish, tap, and municipal water supplies</strong>, KENT Crown Plus-B combines high-performance purification with a <strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"646\">premium black finish</strong> that complements modern kitchen interiors. It delivers safe, healthy, mineral-rich drinking water for your family every day.</p>",
