    "summary": "\\n \\nKENT Grand Plus B uses multiple purification processes of RO+UV+UF+TDS Control to remove all dissolved impurities, bacteria and viruses while retaining essential natural minerals in water with KENT’s mineral RO™ technology. Its UV LED light in the storage tank keeps the purified water bacteria-free for longer dura",
    "description": "<!-- ========================= BEST FEATURES ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">Best Features</h2>\r\\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8;\">\r\\n \t<li>Multiple Purification Process of RO + UV + UF + TDS Control</li>\r\\n \t<li>Makes drinking water 100% pure</li>\r\\n \t<li>Retains essential natural minerals in purified water</li>\r\\n \t<li>UV LED Light keeps purified water pure inside the storage tank</li>\r\\n \t<li>High purification capacity of 20 L/hr</li>\r\\n \t<li>9L storage capacity</li>\r\\n \t<li>1 Year Warranty + 3 Years Free Service</li>\r\\n \t<li>Trusted by about 1 crore satisfied consumers across India</li>\r\\n \t<li>International Quality Certifications: NSF &amp; ISI</li>\r\\n</ul>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<!-- ========================= ABOUT PRODUCT ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">About Product</h2>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\"><strong>KENT Grand Plus RO</strong> features an advanced <strong>RO + UV + UF + TDS Control</strong> purification system that delivers 100% pure and healthy drinking water. It effectively removes bacteria, viruses, chemicals, and dissolved impurities such as arsenic, rust, pesticides, and fluorides while meeting IS:10500 drinking water standards.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">The intelligent <strong>TDS Control</strong> system maintains the desired TDS level while retaining essential natural minerals, ensuring safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water for your family.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">The built-in <strong>UV LED purification system</strong> continuously disinfects the stored water inside the storage tank, preventing bacterial growth and keeping the water fresh and hygienic for longer.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">With a purification capacity of up to <strong>20 litres per hour</strong> and a spacious <strong>9 litre storage tank</strong>, the purifier ensures a continuous supply of purified water even during power outages.</p>\r\\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify;\">Backed by a <strong>1 Year Warranty</strong> and <strong>3 Years Free Service</strong>, KENT Grand Plus RO has earned the trust of more than <strong>1 crore satisfied consumers</strong> across India. It has received numerous national and international awards and is certified by both <strong>BIS</strong> and <strong>NSF</strong>, ensuring world-class quality, safety, and reliability.</p>\r\\n\r\\n</div>\r\\n<!-- ========================= TECHNICAL DETAILS ========================= -->\r\\n<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; margin-top: 30px;\">\r\\n<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">Technical Details</h2>\r\\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd; width: 35%;\">Application</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Suitable for purification of Brackish / Tap / Municipal Corporation Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Product Code</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">1111099B</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Mounting</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Wall Mounting</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Body Material</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">ABS Food Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Purification Capacity</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">20 L/hr</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Storage Capacity</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">9L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Net Weight</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">8.60 Kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Dimensions</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">400 (L) × 230 (W) × 540 (H) mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Input Power Supply</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Single Phase 250V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th style=\"padding: 12px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">Total Power Consumption</th>\r\\n<td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">60W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "<div class=\"kent-short-description\">\r\\n\r\\nKENT Grand Plus B uses multiple purification processes of RO+UV+UF+TDS Control to remove all dissolved impurities, bacteria and viruses while retaining essential natural minerals in water with KENT’s mineral RO™  technology. Its UV LED light in the storage tank keeps the purified water bacteria-free for longer duration. It is ideal for treating brackish, tap and municipal corporation water. It has an elegant black finish that enhances the aesthetics of your modern kitchen.\r\\n\r\\n</div>",
