    "summary": "The A. O. Smith Z9 RO Water Purifier features 8-stage RO + Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT) to deliver 100% RO-purified, baby-safe drinking water. It offers instant warm (45°C) and hot (80°C) water , a 9.2L storage tank , and Advanced Recovery Technology™ that saves up to 2X more water than conventional RO pur",
    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"637\">The <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"84\">A. O. Smith Z9</strong> is a premium <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"127\">8-stage RO water purifier</strong> featuring <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"183\">Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT)</strong> for 100% RO-purified, baby-safe drinking water. It offers <strong data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"286\">instant warm (45°C) and hot (80°C) water</strong> through an electronic touch faucet, making it ideal for modern kitchens. With <strong data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"398\">Advanced Recovery Technology™</strong>, it recovers up to <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"434\">55% of water</strong>, saving up to <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"466\">2X more water</strong> than conventional RO purifiers. Designed for borewell, tanker, and mixed water sources, it combines advanced purification, smart digital features, and elegant aesthetics.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"674\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"674\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"659\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"658\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"674\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"672\">Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"744\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"723\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"722\">Model</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"744\" data-col-size=\"md\">A. O. Smith Z9 RO</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"825\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"775\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"774\">Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"825\">RO + Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"876\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"852\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"851\">Purification Stages</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"876\">8-Stage Purification</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"930\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"896\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"895\">Water Source</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"930\">Borewell, Tanker &amp; Mixed Water</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"968\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"954\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"953\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"968\">9.2 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"990\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"989\">Hot Water Tank</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1004\">0.8 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1021\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1020\">Flow Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1037\">Up to 15 LPH</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1058\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1057\">Recovery Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1071\">Up to 55%</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1091\">TDS Reduction</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1100\">≥95%</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1125\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1124\">Hot Water Options</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1153\">Warm (45°C) &amp; Hot (80°C)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1168\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1167\">Display</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1187\">Digital Display</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1207\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1206\">Installation</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1233\">Wall Mount / Table Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1258\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1257\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1294\">60 W (Purifier), 500 W (Heating)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1315\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1314\">Input Voltage</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1337\">150–300V AC, 50 Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1367\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1366\">Dimensions (H × D × W)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\">482 × 369 × 326 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1407\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1406\">Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1418\">10.8 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "The <strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"64\">A. O. Smith Z9 RO Water Purifier</strong> features <strong data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"132\">8-stage RO + Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT)</strong> to deliver 100% RO-purified, baby-safe drinking water. It offers <strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"242\">instant warm (45°C) and hot (80°C) water</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"267\">9.2L storage tank</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"306\">Advanced Recovery Technology™</strong> that saves up to <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"341\">2X more water</strong> than conventional RO purifiers. With its sleek design, digital display, and compatibility with borewell, tanker, and mixed water sources, the Z9 is an ideal choice for modern homes.",
