    "summary": "\\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n The A. O. Smith ProPlanet P8 RO Water Purifier features advanced 8-stage RO + Silver Shield Technology (SCMT) for 100% RO purified, baby-safe water . It offers ambient, warm (45°C), and hot (80°C) water, a 6.5L anti-bacterial storage tank , up to 60% water recovery , a digital display , and is s",
    "description": "Powered by advanced <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"132\">RO + Silver Shield Technology (SCMT)</strong>, the <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"166\">A. O. Smith ProPlanet P8</strong> delivers <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"213\">100% RO purified, baby-safe water</strong> through its <strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"257\">8-stage purification system</strong>. Enjoy the convenience of <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"324\">ambient, warm (45°C), and hot (80°C)</strong> water at the touch of a button. Featuring a <strong data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"405\">6.5L anti-bacterial storage tank</strong>, <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"435\">up to 60% water recovery</strong>, a <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"458\">digital display</strong>, the P8 is designed for safe, smart, and sustainable hydration. Suitable for <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"622\">borewell, tanker, and mixed water sources</strong> with both <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"673\">wall-mount and tabletop installation</strong>.\r\\n<table>\r\\n<thead>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<th><strong>Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th><strong>Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Model</strong></td>\r\\n<td>A. O. Smith ProPlanet P8 RO</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Water Source</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Borewell, Tanker &amp; Mixed Water Sources</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Installation Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Wall Mount / Table Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td>RO (Reverse Osmosis)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Purification Stages</strong></td>\r\\n<td>8-Stage Purification</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Special Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Silver Shield Technology (SCMT)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Water Temperature Modes</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Ambient, Warm (45°C), Hot (80°C)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Storage Tank Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td>6.5 Litres (Approx.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Purification Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Up to 15 Litres/Hour</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Water Recovery</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Up to 60%</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>TDS Rejection</strong></td>\r\\n<td>≥95% (Approx.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Tank Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Anti-Bacterial Tank</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Display</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Digital Display</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Dispensing Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Mechanical Dispensing</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Pump Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td>24V DC Diaphragm Pump</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Dimensions (H × D × W)</strong></td>\r\\n<td>482 × 293 × 341 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Net Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td>9.8 kg (Approx.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Gross Weight</strong></td>\r\\n<td>12.3 kg (Approx.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Input Voltage</strong></td>\r\\n<td>150–300V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td>48 Watts (Max.)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Operating Pressure</strong></td>\r\\n<td>2–30 psi</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Input Water Temperature</strong></td>\r\\n<td>5°C to 45°C</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Food-Safe, Non-Toxic Engineering Grade Plastics</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Key Features</strong></td>\r\\n<td>Baby-Safe Water, Digital Display, High Water Saving (5-Star Rated), Anti-Bacterial Tank, Hot Water, Lifetime Warranty on Tank</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr>\r\\n<td><strong>Warranty</strong></td>\r\\n<td>1 Year Comprehensive Warranty</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
