    "summary": "\\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n The A.O. Smith X7+ is an advanced 8-stage RO water purifier with Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT) that delivers 100% RO purified, Baby-Safe water . Suitable for borewell, tanker, and municipal water (up to 3000 ppm TDS ), it features a 9L storage tank , digital d",
    "description": "<h3 data-section-id=\"gqkziz\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"694\"></h3>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"550\">The <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"84\">A.O. Smith X7+</strong> is a premium <strong data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"127\">8-stage RO water purifier</strong> featuring <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"183\">Silver Charged Membrane Technology (SCMT)</strong> and a <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"226\">patented Side Stream RO Membrane</strong> for Baby-Safe drinking water. Designed for all water sources—including borewell, tanker, and municipal water—it purifies water with TDS levels up to <strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"388\">3000 ppm</strong>. With a <strong data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"427\">9L food-grade storage tank</strong>, <strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"448\">digital display</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"485\">wall/table-top installation</strong>, it delivers reliable, high-quality purification for every home.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gqkziz\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"584\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"584\">Technical Specifications</strong></span></h3>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"621\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"621\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"606\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"605\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"621\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"619\">Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"733\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"678\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"677\">Purifier Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"733\" data-col-size=\"md\">100% RO + SCMT (Silver Charged Membrane Technology)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"785\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"764\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"763\">Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"785\">8-Stage RO + SCMT</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"847\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"805\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"804\">Water Source</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"847\">Borewell, Tanker &amp; Mixed Water Sources</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"894\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"876\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"875\">Maximum TDS Supported</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"894\" data-col-size=\"md\">Up to 3000 ppm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"930\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"918\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"917\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"930\">9 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"975\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"958\">Purification Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"975\" data-col-size=\"md\">Up to 15 LPH</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"996\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"995\">Recovery Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"1009\">Up to 30%</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1032\">Mounting Options</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1059\" data-col-size=\"md\">Wall Mount / Table Top</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1074\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1073\">Display</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1119\" data-col-size=\"md\">Digital Display with Tank Full Indication</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1150\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1149\">Filter Change Indicator</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1157\" data-col-size=\"md\">Yes</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1182\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1181\">Auto Tank Filling</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1189\" data-col-size=\"md\">Yes</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1210\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1209\">Input Voltage</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1232\" data-col-size=\"md\">150–300V AC / 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1257\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1256\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1270\">48W (Max)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1296\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1295\">Operating Pressure</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1308\" data-col-size=\"md\">7–30 psi</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1329\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1328\">Tank Material</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Food-Grade Plastic</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1381\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1380\">Dimensions (H × D × W)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1403\">490 × 329 × 315 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>",
