    "summary": "\\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n The A.O. Smith U2 Pro+ is a compact under-the-sink UV water purifier designed for municipal water supply. Featuring Next-Gen UVC LED , TwinPure™ Technology , and a Copper Mineraliser , it delivers safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. Its 6-litre storage tank , stylish gooseneck fauce",
    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"603\">The <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"88\">A.O. Smith U2 Pro+</strong> is a premium under-the-sink UV water purifier designed for modern kitchens. Powered by <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"196\">Next-Gen UVC LED</strong> and <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"225\">TwinPure™ Technology</strong>, it passes water twice through the UV chamber for enhanced purification. The built-in <strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"334\">Copper Mineraliser</strong> enriches water with copper, while the <strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"397\">6-litre storage tank</strong> ensures purified water is always available. Ideal for <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"483\">municipal corporation water</strong> with TDS up to <strong data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"510\">250 ppm</strong>, the U2 Pro+ combines compact design, advanced purification, and a stylish gooseneck faucet.\r\\n\r\\n</p>\r\\n\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"1475\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"686\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"686\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"660\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"659\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"686\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"684\">A.O. Smith U2 Pro+</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"1475\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"777\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"759\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"758\">Purifier Placement</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"777\">Under the Sink</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"825\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"798\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"797\">Purifier Type</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"825\" data-col-size=\"md\">UV + Copper Mineraliser</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"881\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"855\">Purification Technology</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"881\">UV (Next-Gen UVC LED)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"933\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"901\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"900\">Water Source</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"933\" data-col-size=\"md\">Municipal Corporation Supply</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"976\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"959\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"958\">Suitable TDS Level</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"976\">Up to 250 ppm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1018\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1001\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1000\">Suitable Hardness</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1018\">Up to 120 ppm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1042\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1041\">Storage Capacity</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1054\">6 Litres</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1077\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1076\">Water Flow Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1102\">Up to 2 Litres/Minute</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1132\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1131\">Dimensions (H × D × W)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1154\">324 × 230 × 236 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1187\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1186\">Tank Dimensions (H × Dia)</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1203\">363 × 230 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1226\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1225\">Pressure Rating</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1238\">5–30 psi</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1259\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1258\">Input Voltage</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1281\">150–300 VAC, 50 Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1322\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1314\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1313\">Maximum Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1322\">36 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1346\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1345\">Special Features</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1426\">TwinPure™ Technology, Copper Mineraliser, Next-Gen UVC LED, Gooseneck Faucet</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>",
