    "description": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"600\">The <strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"71\">A.O. Smith X2 Neo+</strong>is a stylish, compact UV water purifier designed for homes with <strong data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"182\">municipal water supply (TDS below 200 ppm)</strong>. It features an advanced <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"275\">5-stage UV + Ultra Shield + Silver Activated Post Carbon (SAPC)</strong>purification system that delivers safe, healthy, and great-tasting drinking water. Equipped with a <strong data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"394\">digital display</strong>, <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"416\">touch dispensing</strong>, and flexible <strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"470\">wall-mount or tabletop installation</strong>, the X2 Neo is ideal for modern kitchens. As a direct-flow purifier, it provides purified water instantly without a storage tank.</p>\r\\n\r\\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xd84o2\" data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"637\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"637\">Key Specifications – X2 Neo +</strong></span></h3>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\\n<thead data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"674\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"674\">\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"659\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"658\">Specification</strong></th>\r\\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"674\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"672\">Details</strong></th>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</thead>\r\\n<tbody data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\\n<tr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"774\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Water Source</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"774\">Municipal Corporation Supply (TDS &lt; 200 ppm)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"829\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"801\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purification Technology</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"829\">UV + Ultra Shield + SAPC</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"863\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purification Stages</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"863\">5 Stage</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"886\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"880\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Purifier Type</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"886\" data-col-size=\"md\">UV</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"927\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Installation</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"927\">Wall Mount / Tabletop</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"975\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"947\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Storage Capacity</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"975\">No Storage (Direct Flow)</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"988\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flow Rate</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1013\" data-col-size=\"md\">Up to 2 Litres/Minute</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1024\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Display</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1043\">Digital Display</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1057\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dispensing</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1077\">Touch Dispensing</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1094\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Input Voltage</td>\r\\n<td data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1115\" data-col-size=\"md\">150–300V AC, 50Hz</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1136\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Power Consumption</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1148\">36 Watts</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1177\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1165\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV Lamp Power</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1177\">11 Watts</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1199\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Operating Pressure</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1211\">5–30 psi</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1259\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1237\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dimensions (H × D × W)</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1259\">370 × 191 × 300 mm</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1273\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Net Weight</td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1291\">Approx. 3.4 kg</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"></div>\r\\n</div>",
