    "summary": "New Kitchenmate UV (Under the Sink Purifier) \\nExperience pure, refreshing hydration with this advanced domestic water system. Engineered to deliver exceptional water clarity and safety, it ensures your family always has access to clean, healthy drinking water right at home. \\n \\n High-Efficiency Multi-Stage Filtration",
