"1374\">5 NTU</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1398\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1397\">Maximum Chlorine</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1410\">0.2 mg/L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1430\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1429\">Maximum Iron</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1442\">0.1 mg/L</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1463\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1462\">UV Lamp Power</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1471\">11 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1491\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1490\">UV Lamp Life</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1514\">8,000 Burning Hours</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1539\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1538\">Power Consumption</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1547\">50 W</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n<tr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1612\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\\n<td data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1570\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1569\">Water Flow Rate</strong></td>\r\\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1612\" data-is-last-node=\"\">RO: 200–250 ml/min, UV: 550–650 ml/min</td>\r\\n</tr>\r\\n</tbody>\r\\n</table>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</div>\r\\n</section></div>\r\\n</div>",
    "shortDescription": "<strong>The Aquaguard Eden SS a</strong>n advanced <strong data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"60\">RO + UV water purifier</strong> with <strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"82\">UV e-Boiling</strong>, <strong data-start=\"84\" data-end=\"112\">Active Copper Technology</strong>, and a <strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"162\">304-grade stainless steel storage tank</strong>. Designed to provide safe, healthy drinking water with smart features, energy-efficient operation, and reliable performance even in low water pressure conditions.",
