    "summary": "\\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n \\n Aquaguard Sure Champ is a 6-stage RO+UV water purifier with Nanopore Long-Life Filter Technology, delivering safe and healthy drinking water by removing bacteria, viruses, heavy metals, pesticides, and microplastics. Featuring Aquasaver RO Technology, UV e-Boi",
